<title>NETHERLANDS: DAMCO JOINS P&amp;O NEDLLOYD JT VENTURE.</title>
<headline>DAMCO JOINS P&amp;O NEDLLOYD JT VENTURE.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Koninklijke Nedlloyd Groep NV said on Friday its Damco Maritime freight-forwarding unit would become part of P&amp;O Nedlloyd, its 50-50 container shipping joint venture with Britain's P&amp;O Plc.</p>
<p>Nedlloyd said Damco would continue to operate as an independent freight forwarder but would gain greater access to international markets as part of P&amp;O Nedlloyd.</p>
<p>The Dutch company added that the move would not have any consequences for Damco's 470 employees.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
